  "manual": {
    "summary": "Web Core Navigation Tabs содержит standalone-компоненты primary и secondary tabs. Он задаёт baseline values для TabsPrimary и TabPrimary, но composite components вроде TabsView могут владеть другими effective baselines через собственные composition contracts.",
    "criticalBaselines": [
      "Standalone TabsPrimary / Items / TabPrimary has layout.itemSpacing = 12.",
      "Standalone TabPrimary label has text style Paragraph/18–24 Primary Large.",
      "If [D] TabsView reports TabPrimary 12 → 16 or Paragraph/18–24 → Action/18–24, first check TabsView composition-contract: those can be host-owned effective baselines, not designer customizations."
    ],
    "agentInstructions": [
      "Do not call TabsView-owned nested overrides violations when actual equals the TabsView effective baseline.",
      "Use this core Tabs contract to identify standalone baselines and component keys.",
      "Use the host component composition-contract to decide whether a nested difference is owned by the host wrapper or by the designer."
    ]
